# Trims the build context. Do NOT add `*.md`, `docs/`, or `config/` here: the
# runtime image COPYs config/ and agents/ (prompt.md, agent-card.json,
# rubric.yaml/rubric.md, SKILL.md, ...) wholesale from the context - excluding
# any of those paths would silently ship a broken image.
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
internal/serve/web/dist/assets
/quack
*.test
*.out
.env
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
